## How to update this document

When You add a new dependency:

1. Add an entry here with: package name, license SPDX identifier,
   upstream URL, which sub-project uses it.
2. Update the corresponding `requirements.txt` / `Cargo.toml` /
   `package.json` to pin a version.
3. Open a PR; reviewers will check the license compatibility with
   OIE-PCS-1.0.


